	I was recently playing a low-level character and found a shop.
Having already found a wand of polymorph, I decided, what the heck,
I'll try it on the shopkeeper.  Unfortunately, she turned into
a different nasty and killed me.  (OK, maybe her new form wasn't
*that* strong, but my character was low-level.)

	Here's the thing.  In my death message, it said, "Killed
by Ms. Possogroenoe, the shopkeeper."  I think it would have been
more interesting if it said, "Killed by Ms. Possogroenoe, the ettin
mummy."

